arc-plc/west-virginia/nicholas-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 33 of those years. In 2025, August to September landed at 46% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 74% and April to May at 74% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
